{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Totto's Magic Soup",
    "steam_appid": 3415840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/67f73f5a145e8abe6cd25da461b7e193.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span><strong><br>A Sudden Incident in the Peaceful Nyacle Village!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totto and Chiro return from their part-time job collecting medicinal herbs, only to find that the residents of Nyakuru Village have turned to stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore them, they need the power of &quot;Soup&quot; made in the Magic Pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Totto on an adventurous journey to gather soup recipes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/cc2f741ca0ad134ff1f7f6fb0b405af2.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World of Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alnial Region is filled with unique and diverse locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stump village where cats live</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A farming village inhabited by dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subterranean village home to lizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even a forest covered in cake...!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/228a4195f8f9d7ba7e4243cf7394ebef.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting Recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soup recipes can be obtained by helping villagers with their requests or by defeating bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When visiting a new place for the first time, be sure to check the bookshelves in the houses\u2014you never know what you might find!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/e079ada4ca3a22120acbc3ad79471348.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooking\u00a0Soup</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've found a recipe, gather the ingredients and brew the magical soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By giving the stone-turned villagers their favorite soup, you can break the petrification curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the notes from Chiro to deduce which soup each cat loves the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/6730d1dc3e6fc5c7f5b88a37845185c1.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat follows a classic turn-based system, but some enemies may be resistant to regular attacks or unleash powerful moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to boss dialogues\u2014they may contain hints on how to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/3a4cd0fa5f4d1a09f0b091a4caed4095.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plenty of Collectibles</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2460 Finding Pori-Pori</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forty &quot;Pori-Pori&quot; have escaped from Parco and are hiding all over the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you listen carefully in the field, you might hear the sound of a hidden Poripori!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/da32ae845944fdf756da6554fa681b0b.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2461 Ancient Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you obtain a shovel, you can dig at marked spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you uncover an ancient relic, take it to Tonbo the archaeologist for analysis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/343ebc42a46f8abdcd4623336017767f.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2462 Stamp Book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you'll receive a Stamp Book that lets you play mini-games at stamp stations across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe the sample designs and create pixel art stamps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/fd1039c4213b9ee24224036855591893.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2463 Commemorative Stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post office somewhere in Arnyarl, you can receive commemorative stamps based on your achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 12 types in total\u2014try to collect them all!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/67f73f5a145e8abe6cd25da461b7e193.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span><strong><br>A Sudden Incident in the Peaceful Nyacle Village!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totto and Chiro return from their part-time job collecting medicinal herbs, only to find that the residents of Nyakuru Village have turned to stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore them, they need the power of &quot;Soup&quot; made in the Magic Pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Totto on an adventurous journey to gather soup recipes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/cc2f741ca0ad134ff1f7f6fb0b405af2.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World of Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alnial Region is filled with unique and diverse locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stump village where cats live</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A farming village inhabited by dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subterranean village home to lizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even a forest covered in cake...!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/228a4195f8f9d7ba7e4243cf7394ebef.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting Recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soup recipes can be obtained by helping villagers with their requests or by defeating bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When visiting a new place for the first time, be sure to check the bookshelves in the houses\u2014you never know what you might find!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/e079ada4ca3a22120acbc3ad79471348.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooking\u00a0Soup</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've found a recipe, gather the ingredients and brew the magical soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By giving the stone-turned villagers their favorite soup, you can break the petrification curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the notes from Chiro to deduce which soup each cat loves the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/6730d1dc3e6fc5c7f5b88a37845185c1.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat follows a classic turn-based system, but some enemies may be resistant to regular attacks or unleash powerful moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to boss dialogues\u2014they may contain hints on how to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/3a4cd0fa5f4d1a09f0b091a4caed4095.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plenty of Collectibles</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2460 Finding Pori-Pori</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forty &quot;Pori-Pori&quot; have escaped from Parco and are hiding all over the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you listen carefully in the field, you might hear the sound of a hidden Poripori!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/da32ae845944fdf756da6554fa681b0b.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2461 Ancient Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you obtain a shovel, you can dig at marked spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you uncover an ancient relic, take it to Tonbo the archaeologist for analysis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/343ebc42a46f8abdcd4623336017767f.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2462 Stamp Book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you'll receive a Stamp Book that lets you play mini-games at stamp stations across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe the sample designs and create pixel art stamps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415840/extras/fd1039c4213b9ee24224036855591893.avif?t=1751677343\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2463 Commemorative Stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post office somewhere in Arnyarl, you can receive commemorative stamps based on your achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 12 types in total\u2014try to collect them all!</p>",
